&lt;p&gt;The base salary for this role is expected to range from $175,000 - $270,000 on an annualized basis, or potentially greater in the event that your &#39;level&#39; of proficiency exceeds the level expected for the role. The salary range will be determined by the candidate’s geographic location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We expect to award a meaningful equity grant for this role. With quarterly vesting, your first vest date will take place within 3 months of your start date.&lt;/p&gt;
