&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with consumer products, user-generated content, and ad-supported business models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with version‑controlled code (e.g., GitHub) and scripting in Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with agile or kanban workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
